    <item>
      <title>Connected-3H3T3B</title>
      <link>https://shura-turtle.github.io/post/connected-3h3t3b/</link>
      <pubDate>Sun, 07 Jun 2026 13:17:16 &#43;0630</pubDate>
      <author>xxx@xxx.com (shura-turtle)</author>
      <guid>https://shura-turtle.github.io/post/connected-3h3t3b/</guid>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<h1>Connected-3H3T3B</h1><p>Author: shura-turtle(xxx@xxx.com)</p>
        
          <p><img src="/images/connected/connected.png" alt="image"> Connected</p>
<p><img src="/images/connected/1.png" alt="image"></p>
<p>ဒီမှာဆိုရင် machine လေးစလိုက်ပြီးရင် ip ‌လေးရလာပါလိမ့်မယ် vpn ချိတ်ပြီးရင်</p>
<h2 id="recon">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#recon"></a>
Recon
</h2><blockquote>
<p>ping machine_ip</p>
</blockquote>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">PING machine_ip <span class="o">(</span>machine_ip<span class="o">)</span> 56<span class="o">(</span>84<span class="o">)</span> bytes of data.
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="m">64</span> bytes from machine_ip: <span class="nv">icmp_seq</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="m">1</span> <span class="nv">ttl</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="m">63</span> <span class="nv">time</span><span class="o">=</span>5.33 ms
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="m">64</span> bytes from machine_ip: <span class="nv">icmp_seq</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="m">2</span> <span class="nv">ttl</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="m">63</span> <span class="nv">time</span><span class="o">=</span>1.14 ms
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="m">64</span> bytes from machine_ip: <span class="nv">icmp_seq</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="m">3</span> <span class="nv">ttl</span><span class="o">=</span><span class="m">63</span> <span class="nv">time</span><span class="o">=</span>2.39 ms
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ဒီလိုမျိုးလေးတွေရလာရင် စပြီးတော့ pentest လို့ရပါပြီ machine box ကို</p>
<p>nmap နဲ့စပြီး port scan ပါမယ်</p>
<blockquote>
<p>nmap -sC -sV -oN nmap_top_svc.txt &lt;machine_ip&gt;</p>
</blockquote>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash"><span class="line"><span class="cl">22/tcp   open  ssh      OpenSSH 7.4
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">80/tcp   open  http     Apache httpd 2.4.6
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">443/tcp  open  ssl/http Apache httpd 2.4.6 
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>80 and 443 port ရှိတယ်ဆိုတော့ webserver လေးရှိပါတယ်</p>
        
        <hr><p>Published on 2026-06-07 at <a href='https://shura-turtle.github.io/'>shura-turtle</a>, last modified on 2026-06-07</p>]]>
      </description>
      
    </item>
    
    

    <item>
      <title>Overflow1</title>
      <link>https://shura-turtle.github.io/post/overflow1/</link>
      <pubDate>Thu, 04 Jun 2026 13:14:01 &#43;0630</pubDate>
      <author>xxx@xxx.com (shura-turtle)</author>
      <guid>https://shura-turtle.github.io/post/overflow1/</guid>
      <description>
        <![CDATA[<h1>Overflow1</h1><p>Author: shura-turtle(xxx@xxx.com)</p>
        
          <h1 id="challenge-file">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#challenge-file"></a>
challenge file
</h1><p><a href="https://github.com/shura-turtle/educational-1">overflowme1</a></p>
<h2 id="analysis">
<a class="header-anchor" href="#analysis"></a>
Analysis
</h2><blockquote>
<p>overflowme1 ကို ida pro နဲ့ analyse တဲ့အခါမှာ</p>
</blockquote>
<div class="highlight"><pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-c" data-lang="c"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="kr">__fastcall</span> <span class="nf">main</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">argc</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="k">const</span> <span class="kt">char</span> <span class="o">**</span><span class="n">argv</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="k">const</span> <span class="kt">char</span> <span class="o">**</span><span class="n">envp</span><span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="n">_BYTE</span> <span class="n">v4</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="mi">23</span><span class="p">];</span> <span class="c1">// [rsp+0h] [rbp-30h] BYREF
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="kt">char</span> <span class="n">v5</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="c1">// [rsp+17h] [rbp-19h]
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="n">FILE</span> <span class="o">*</span><span class="n">stream</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="c1">// [rsp+18h] [rbp-18h]
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="kt">char</span> <span class="o">*</span><span class="n">filename</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="c1">// [rsp+20h] [rbp-10h]
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">v8</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="c1">// [rsp+2Ch] [rbp-4h]
</span></span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="nf">setup</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">argc</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">argv</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">envp</span><span class="p">);</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="nf">banner</span><span class="p">();</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="n">v8</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="nf">puts</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;Please go ahead and leave a comment :&#34;</span><span class="p">);</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="nf">gets</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">v4</span><span class="p">);</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="k">if</span> <span class="p">(</span> <span class="o">!</span><span class="n">v8</span> <span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nf">puts</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;Bye bye</span><span class="se">\n</span><span class="s">&#34;</span><span class="p">);</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nf">exit</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">);</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="p">}</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="n">filename</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="s">&#34;flag.txt&#34;</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="n">stream</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nf">fopen</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="s">&#34;flag.txt&#34;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="s">&#34;r&#34;</span><span class="p">);</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="k">while</span> <span class="p">(</span> <span class="mi">1</span> <span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="n">v5</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="nf">fgetc</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">stream</span><span class="p">);</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="k">if</span> <span class="p">(</span> <span class="n">v5</span> <span class="o">==</span> <span class="o">-</span><span class="mi">1</span> <span class="p">)</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">      <span class="k">break</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="nf">putchar</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">v5</span><span class="p">);</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="p">}</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="nf">fclose</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">stream</span><span class="p">);</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">  <span class="k">return</span> <span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">}</span>
</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ဒီမှာဆိုရင် gets(v4) -&gt; v4 က [23] byte accept ပြီး အဲ့ထက်ကျော်အောင်ရေးလို့ရတယ် size check မပါလို့ အဲ့ကြောင်း buffer overflow ဖြစ်တယ်</p>
        
        <hr><p>Published on 2026-06-04 at <a href='https://shura-turtle.github.io/'>shura-turtle</a>, last modified on 2026-06-04</p>]]>
      </description>
      
